#reason api/src/handlers/heartRate.ts Accepts batched readings so a flaky watch link loses nothing.
#reason watch/Sources/HeartRateSync.swift Queues readings on the watch and retries instead of dropping them.
#reason api/src/routes.ts Exposes the new heart-rate endpoint.
#reason web/src/api/legacyPoller.ts Polling is replaced by the sync queue, so the client has no caller left.
